# 7. JSONL Replay Source

NICAI supports replay workflows based on structured runtime records.

Where JSONL is used:

```text
One line
=
One runtime event
```

Example:

```json
{"trace_id":"TRACE_001","event_type":"INPUT","status":"SUCCESS"}
{"trace_id":"TRACE_001","event_type":"VALIDATION","status":"SUCCESS"}
{"trace_id":"TRACE_001","event_type":"ANALYSIS","status":"SUCCESS"}
{"trace_id":"TRACE_001","event_type":"PATTERN","status":"SUCCESS"}
{"trace_id":"TRACE_001","event_type":"OUTPUT","status":"SUCCESS"}
```

The records can be ordered and associated with the same execution using `trace_id`.

The example above is illustrative and is not itself production evidence.

